  "_readme": [
    "Hand-edited extras for the college lookup. Keys are exact IPEDS names from colleges.json.",
    "color: the card bar and pin color (hex). aliases: other names people may type in the sheet.",
    "To add a college that is not in IPEDS, give it lat and lon (plus city and state), e.g.",
    "\"My College\": { \"color\": \"#123456\", \"lat\": 33.7, \"lon\": -84.4, \"city\": \"Atlanta\", \"state\": \"GA\" }",
    "Colors are close approximations; adjust any that look off.",
    "logo: a logo image for the student card, used instead of the one found automatically.",
    "Put the file in assets/logos/ and write \"logo\": \"assets/logos/emory.png\" (or paste an image URL)."
  ],
